Subject: Complete selected accel-ppp-ng security and dependent stability backports

See inventory.json and upstream/ for complete original commits, authors, hashes,
ordered dependencies and the one already-present accounting hunk. This is the
complete before/after result; combining history permits strict repeat detection.

